[
 ["the rebuild stops adding its pages", "rebuild", "for s in \"${OK[@]}\"; do git -C \"$WEB\" add \"v/$s\"", "for s in \"${OK[@]}\"; do : \"$WEB\" \"v/$s\"", 1],
